WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.850
The New Founding Fathers of America are the
fictional political party known for creating

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:04.850
The Purge.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.979
On their website, they mention some of the
crime sprees in human history that led up

00:00:07.979 --> 00:00:08.979
to their inception.

00:00:08.979 --> 00:00:13.960
They include a 1971 riot at a New York prison,
the Jonestown massacre in 1978, the Edmond,

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:17.640
Oklahoma post office incident in 1986, and
the LA Riots in 1992.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:21.759
Those are all real events, so it seems 2014
is where the fictional timeline starts to

00:00:21.759 --> 00:00:23.150
diverge from our own.

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:27.470
From 2014, they mention two crime sprees,
The Queensbridge Incident and the Covina Alley

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:31.849
Murders, as events that incited a public outcry
for protection and vengeance against the increasing

00:00:31.849 --> 00:00:33.020
number of homeless.

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:36.960
It’s not clear if the actual outcry was
against the homeless, or if the NFFA just

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.510
said that as part of their agenda.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:42.660
Either way it worked, and they began to gain
popularity, due in part to huge donations

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:46.460
from the National Rifle Association, who sought
to protect themselves from the growing movement

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:47.460
to ban firearms.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.239
REPORTER: A new party is arising as a substitute
to the Republicans and Democrats, calling

00:00:52.239 --> 00:00:55.019
themselves the New Founding Fathers of America."

00:00:55.019 --> 00:00:58.879
Twenty-fourteen was the year that the NFFA
was founded, probably hoping to capitalize

00:00:58.879 --> 00:01:00.910
on a time of great civil unrest.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:05.550
To learn all about their history, as detailed
in the now-defunct NFFA website and how it

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:09.659
gives greater meaning to the events seen in
The Purge movies and TV series, stick around

00:01:09.659 --> 00:01:11.281
to the end of this video.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:17.090
Welcome to Horror History.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:21.340
Today we’ll be studying a new kind of history,
as I cover The New Founding Fathers of America.

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:24.899
It’s impossible to talk about them without
also covering the history of what they consider

00:01:24.899 --> 00:01:27.400
their crowning achievement: The Annual Purge.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:30.439
The New Founding Fathers were named to bring
thoughts of America’s original founding

00:01:30.439 --> 00:01:33.590
fathers who united the colonies of America
in 1776.

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:37.900
They are also sometimes known as the NFA,
the New Founders of America for short.

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:41.675
The NFFA managed to stay in power for nearly
a quarter of a century, so we’ve got a lot

00:01:41.675 --> 00:01:42.472
to cover.

00:01:42.472 --> 00:01:43.711
Let’s get into it.

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:52.649
The NFFA’s policies have aspects of many
real political parties, but their hidden long

00:01:52.649 --> 00:01:56.596
term agenda is profiteering by eliminating
the lower class, which they see as being below

00:01:56.596 --> 00:01:57.189
them.

00:01:57.189 --> 00:02:00.780
Some of their policies don’t seem so bad,
but they use sneaky language to hide their

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:01.780
true intent.

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:06.420
For example, they claim to support equal opportunity,
but exclude those who they don’t consider

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:07.420
“contributing citizens”.

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:11.039
In other words, employers can’t discriminate
against you for being homeless, but they can

00:02:11.039 --> 00:02:15.060
discriminate against you for not contributing
to society, aka, being jobless.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:18.230
Their most controversial stance, of course,
is their stance on crime.

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:21.740
They claim that aggression is a part of human
nature that needs to be released, so they

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:25.530
planned a science experiment called The Purge
to see if overall crime could be reduced by

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:27.410
containing it all to one night.

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:28.410
More on that later.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:32.010
They support an investment in eco-technology
to keep the environment clean.

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:33.010
That’s good.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.010
I can get behind that one.

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:38.190
But even here we see that they can’t help
but mention that this is part of an overall

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:41.570
“cleanse” which involves their idea of
“cleansing” out those that are less fortunate.

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:46.300
On the topic of National Security, they plan
to reinstate the military draft in 2023 to

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:49.701
offset the drop in enlistment by impoverished
people and also believe that serving in the

00:02:49.701 --> 00:02:52.879
armed forces will better prepare the youth
for purging at home.

00:02:52.879 --> 00:02:56.000
This is one of those details that’s disturbing
in so many different ways.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:59.769
The most messed up part is that it seems to
be part of their effort to brainwash the country’s

00:02:59.769 --> 00:03:03.270
youth into becoming killing machines, which
we’ll see more of with their new policies a few

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:04.270
years later.

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:07.630
It seems like the incentive here is to keep
the people battling each other, not battling

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:08.630
the government.

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:12.049
Their take on personal security really shows
their ulterior motives if we analyse it.

00:03:12.049 --> 00:03:16.129
Their idea of “security” has more to do
with arming yourself with dangerous weapons,

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:17.709
than creating preventive measures.

00:03:17.709 --> 00:03:21.480
It’s very telling that their solution to
violence is more violence, and it is perhaps

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:25.120
the first clue that they are under the thumb
of the gun manufacturing industry, a fact

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.930
that is used against them more and more as
time goes on.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.840
Finally, we have their policy on Science and
Technology.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:34.900
This is perhaps the most puzzling. They claim
to be working with other countries to protect

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:39.280
the US from China’s recent advancements
in space exploration, artificial intelligence

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.460
and rejuvenation research.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:44.379
Artificial intelligence can be used maliciously,
and it is.

00:03:44.379 --> 00:03:48.650
But why do we need to protect ourselves from
space exploration and rejuvenation?

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:51.250
There’s something a little fishy about that.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:55.000
In the time leading up the NFFA taking power,
unemployment continued to rise.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:59.549
People were protesting, asking for well paying
jobs and an end to police brutality, multiple

00:03:59.549 --> 00:04:01.904
wars and a significant dollar devaluation.

00:04:02.463 --> 00:04:05.267
REPORTER: Unemployment rising across the nation.

00:04:05.267 --> 00:04:08.960
REPORTER #2: Stock market down another 2,000
points in the largest drop in its history.

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:11.769
REPORTER #3: A subprime mortgage crisis worse
than 2008.

00:04:11.769 --> 00:04:15.180
REPORTER #4: Neighborhoods across the country
destroyed by an opioid epidemic.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:17.252
REPORTER #5: Protests across the nation.

00:04:17.252 --> 00:04:20.894
Americans are looking for a necessary change
in these tumultuous times.

00:04:20.894 --> 00:04:24.270
It seems they first gained office in 2014
with the election of President Bracken.

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:27.830
I guess the election cycle in the world of
The Purge does not line up with that of the

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:30.860
real world, where the new terms began in 2013
and 2017.

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:37.280
“As your elected president, with my fellow
New Founding Fathers, we make this promise.

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:39.870
We will revive this country.

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:42.720
The American dream is dead.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:46.730
We will do whatever it takes to let you dream
again.”

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:51.390
Just months later, Bracken institutes a controversial
experiment -- one night of legalized crime

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:55.660
in Staten Island known as The Purge, with
the idea that people can get their anger out,

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:58.510
and it will actually reduce crime overall
for the rest of the year.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:01.760
Interestingly, this solution doesn’t 
have anything to do with any of the problems

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.070
people have been upset about.

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:07.030
The NFFA’s Chief of Staff, Arlo Sabien,
helped to push the Purge experiment through

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:08.930
Congress, effectively helping put it into
law.

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:11.260
It’s not entirely clear when this occurs.

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:15.040
In Anarchy, we find out that the 2023 Purge
is the 6th Annual Purge.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:18.810
“The 6th annual Purge will begin in 45 minutes.”

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:22.070
...meaning the first annual purge would have
been 2018.

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:25.820
But we also see in the opening of the original
movie, that there are nationwide Purges in

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:28.100
both 2017 and 2018.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:31.720
The Experimental Purge only took place on
Staten Island, suggesting that it took place

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.820
one year before, in 2016.

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:39.400
“We’re considering a nationwide Purge,
as the people are now calling it, as early

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.650
as next year.”

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:44.940
So that leaves the question, if The First
Experimental Purge took place in 2016, and

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:49.690
The First Annual Purge took place in 2018,
what was this nationwide Purge in 2017?

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:52.870
I’m guessing there was a Second Experimental
Purge that year.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:56.850
The movie, The First Purge, refers to the
experiment as The First Experimental Purge,

00:05:56.850 --> 00:06:00.300
which would suggest that there was a Second
Experimental Purge, this time, it would be

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.120
a nationwide experiment.

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:06.600
So Bracken took office in 2014, and planned
the first experimental Purge to take place

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:10.904
in 2016, but they would have to employ some
dirty tactics to get this project rolling.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:24.520
The NFFA takes the public’s perception of
this experimental Purge very seriously, going

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:29.280
so far as to hold auditions for the perfect
voice actress to announce it’s commencement.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.990
“This is not a test.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:37.900
This is your emergency broadcast system, announcing
the commencement of The Annual Purge, sanctioned

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:39.620
by the US government.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:43.530
Notice how even before they’ve run their
experiment, the NFFA is already planning to

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:47.330
make The Purge an annual event, evidence that
they never planned to wait for the data from

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:50.451
the experiment -- they already had their minds
made up that they’d be going forward with

00:06:50.451 --> 00:06:51.570
it in future years.

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:55.911
The proposition divides the country even further,
and protests break out nationwide, including

00:06:55.911 --> 00:07:00.770
conflict between anti-Purge protesters and
those who support the idea of The Purge in North Carolina,

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.800
which resulted in at least 20 arrests.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:07.020
This controversy, which I remind you is a
fictional one, becomes a worldwide issue.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:10.610
The Pope condemns the idea, and the President
of France calls for a trade embargo with the

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:12.550
US if the experiment is not stopped.

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:16.960
Remember, the NFFA, like a generic hip-hop
video, is all about money, and they would

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:20.840
use it to make sure The Purge Experiment sends
the message they want it to send.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:24.170
They recruited citizens to participate in
The Purge to try to prove to the rest of the

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:28.520
country that humans naturally need to release
their violence, but rather than rely on their

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:32.020
hypothesis, they interfere by offering money
to low-income citizens who decide to stay

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:36.680
on Staten Island during the experiment for
a payment in the amount of $5000, with additional

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.020
incentives for those who participate themselves.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:42.200
The proposal was also put to vote for Staten
Island citizens, and because the majority

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:46.240
of the population was in a dire financial
situation, they voted Yes on it, much to the

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:48.000
dismay of many pacifists.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.680
The sign up stations are strategically placed
near low income housing projects to try to

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.930
get the most desperate people to participate.

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:57.860
Staten Island is also the home of numerous
street gangs that they want to coax into participating.

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:01.990
To try to increase their credibility, Sabien
brings on a behavioural scientist named Dr.

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:03.610
May Updale to run the experiment.

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:05.710
“I do not work for the NFFA.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.110
I did not conceive of the experiment for them.

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:13.770
The NFFA had the courage to test it, but the
conceit is not a political one.

00:08:13.770 --> 00:08:15.400
It is a psychological one.

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:20.220
The benefit of acting violently without worry
of consequence, that's a freeing violence.”

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:25.197
However, the NFFA has no plans to run a legitimate
experiment, as Dr. Updale would soon find

00:08:25.197 --> 00:08:25.765
out.

00:08:25.765 --> 00:08:29.940
Each participant who shows up to Purge is
given a box with a few items: the blue baptisia

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.970
flowers, meant to be a symbol of rebirth.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:36.300
A baptism is a religious ceremony of cleansing
and rebirth, but in this case, the NFFA is

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:38.590
celebrating the violent rebirth of the nation.

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:41.159
They also supply recording contact lenses.

00:08:41.159 --> 00:08:44.250
Participants are told these will document
their actions so that they can get paid, but

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:47.950
their main purpose is to broadcast the night’s
events out to the rest of America, helping

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.530
push the NFFA’s "violence is a release"
narrative.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:52.610
They also implant a tracking device on the
Purgers.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:56.641
Again, while this seems for making sure the
person actually stayed on the island, these

00:08:56.641 --> 00:09:00.150
are actually in place for the government to
easily track down and purge anyone they

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:02.000
see unfit for their society.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:06.680
Arlo Sabien has a backup plan in case organic
participation doesn’t live up to his expectation

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:09.930
and he won't accept any result other than
the one he planned for.

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:15.300
The NFFA surrounds the island with military
forces, ensuring nobody can get off the island,

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:18.220
because that would also not fit their narrative,
they want to make it look like everyone has

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:22.140
just been waiting their entire lives to Purge
and sell the idea that the country as a whole

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.490
is excited for it.

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:27.500
Sabien and Updale keep tabs on the happenings
of The Purge in a high tech NFFA facility

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:31.420
nearby, and watch as President Bracken gives
an address before the first sirens sound.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.800
The beginning of the Purge doesn’t go as
Sabien had hoped.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:38.150
There is graffiti, there’s public drinking,
but very little violent crime; the only fatal

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:42.250
Purge coming from a man who goes by Skeletor
who was already very mentally unstable.

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:46.110
Upon seeing it, Sabien’s top priority is
getting it out to the media for all to see.

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:49.410
There are a couple traps set in the street,
but they don’t turn out to be a real threat,

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:50.410
and the evening goes on.

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:53.250
There’s an armed robbery, but again, no
lives are lost.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.540
Frustration sets in for Arlo Sabien.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.380
SABIEN: “There’s nothing happening.”

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:58.720
EMPLOYEE: “Look at this.

00:09:58.720 --> 00:09:59.813
Some kind of block party.”

00:09:59.813 --> 00:10:00.625
SABIEN: “Parties?

00:10:00.625 --> 00:10:01.880
Are you kidding me?”

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:05.600
Skeletor claims another victim at the block
party, causing Updale to believe that it’s

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:08.140
starting, but it’s still an overall disappointing
showing for Sabien.

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:11.190
SABIEN: “You predicted a much higher level
of participation.”

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:12.960
UPDALE: “We should have expected the unexpected.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:13.960
This is an experiment.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:14.960
There are variables.”

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.500
SABIEN: The NFFA put a lot of faith into this
evening.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:19.750
If it's deemed ineffective, the entire regime
could be judged as a failure.”

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:23.030
UPDALE: I told you that science does not obey
the laws of politics.

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:26.940
My job is to analyze this data, nothing more."

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:31.610
Sabien has seen enough and resorts to Plan
B. The NFFA has secretly recruited violent

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:35.430
groups, such as the KKK and hired them to
come in to artificially increase the amount

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:38.720
of purging in order to make it look like regular
citizens had purged.

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:42.010
Suddenly there are Purgers everywhere, and
Updale can’t figure out why.

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:44.690
“All the data supported early violent behaviour,
and then a downturn.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:47.190
This doesn’t make any sense.”

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:51.340
Sabien warns her not to question it, but of
course, that only makes her more suspicious.

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:55.210
She discovers that after being dispatched
from an abandoned factory in the area, they drove

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:57.030
directly to the most crowded areas.

00:10:57.030 --> 00:11:00.670
This causes Updale to realize that they must
have had access to the data from the tracking

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:02.610
chips implanted on the people who stayed on
the island.

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:06.130
In other words, these weren’t just gangs,
they were NFFA hired.

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:10.090
But before she can expose this information
to the public, her snooping around is discovered

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:11.260
by Sabien.

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:15.050
“You’re making it look like people are
participating because there wasn’t enough

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.050
purging.”

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:20.181
He explains that he only did it because there
was too much overpopulation, crime, unemployment

00:11:20.181 --> 00:11:23.991
and bankruptcy, arguing that the country can’t
afford to care for its own citizens, though

00:11:23.991 --> 00:11:27.970
she doubts that the NFFA’s statistics on
such things are even accurate at this point.

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:28.970
“Come on.

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:29.970
Come on.

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:35.740
We both know there's... there's no easy answer
where somebody... some group, doesn't suffer.”

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:39.660
He tells her that her country will remember
her fondly, and has his thugs abduct her and

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:43.470
drop her off in the middle of The Purge where
a group of NFFA henchmen are waiting.

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:47.210
Meanwhile, down on Staten Island, one of the
gang leaders mobilizes his men to try to take

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:51.180
the mercenaries out, which still plays into
the NFFA’s hands; they’re still accomplishing

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:53.720
their mission as long as a lot of fighting
takes place.

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:56.189
And things were about to go down.

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:12.491
Another tactic the NFFA uses to try to create
the impression of greater participation in

00:12:12.491 --> 00:12:15.630
the experiment is using attack drones to take
people out.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:18.620
By doing this, they could eliminate those
that they don’t see fit, while easily hiding

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:22.740
the fact that they were piloting the drones,
making it look like the work of any random

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:23.740
citizen.

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:26.400
The majority of the country never discovers
that the whole experiment was corrupt, but

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.840
those who fought for their lives that night
decide to start a resistance, and they would

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:34.240
be the earliest seeds of what would eventually
grow into the NFFA’s biggest detractors.

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:38.310
Ironically, Arlo Sabien runs with the narrative
that the turnout was bigger than they expected,

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:40.020
when really the opposite had been true.

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:43.690
He promises to study the results, and President
Bracken announces that they’re considering

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:46.220
a nationwide purge as early as next year.

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:49.730
“One where every US citizen can participate.”

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:54.100
Before that would occur, the NFFA installs
speakers every 3.7 blocks across the country

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:57.720
so that everyone can hear the sirens announcing
the beginning and end of each Purge.

00:12:57.720 --> 00:13:01.070
They also put together surveillance teams
in each city, to document all the activity

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:03.300
that happens during the nationwide experiment.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.541
These surveillance agents, formally known
as the visual analytics department, become

00:13:06.541 --> 00:13:10.350
known as the eyes in the sky, and they are
mostly there to enforce the few rules that

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.110
do still exist on Purge night, and to prosecute
anyone whose crimes don’t come to a stop

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:15.450
as the final siren sounds.

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:18.730
Of course, they don’t have an agent to keep
an eye on every single purger, but with the

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:22.920
help of an artificial intelligence system
the agents they do have can monitor any activity

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.380
that looks suspicious.

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:29.160
On March 14th 2017, one week before the first
national purge, an NFFA team in New Orleans

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:32.620
has a little bit of trouble gaining access
to their secure safe room and in a panic,

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:36.710
call James Sandin, the head and top salesman
of Sandin Security, who installed their system.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:40.580
This interaction shows that the NFFA doesn’t
even believe in their own policies.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:44.600
They claim that allowing citizens to own firearms
is the best personal security solution.

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:47.810
What would people say if they saw how nervous
this guy was when he couldn’t get into his

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:50.990
reinforced safety room surrounded by bulletproof
glass?

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:55.260
We only see surveillance footage of this 2017
Nationwide Purge Experiment, but can assume

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:59.170
it played out in a similar way to the Staten
Island Experiment, with the NFFA interfering

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.180
to ensure optimal participation.

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:04.980
It was likely not long after that, when the
28th Amendment to the United States Constitution

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:09.480
was ratified, ensuring that The Purge would
be a yearly right to all American citizens.

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:11.110
The bill contains five sections.

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:14.900
Note that the NFA website uses June 7th as
the date of The Purge in order to promote

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:18.200
the release date of the movie, so I’ll just
go ahead and change that screenshot to the

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:19.400
correct dates.

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:23.730
SECTION 1: The Annual Purge shall begin each
year on March 21st at sunset, officially starting

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:27.800
at 7PM, and ending at sunrise, March 22nd,
at 7AM.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:31.790
SECTION 2: During the time of The Purge, any
and all crime, up to and including murder,

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:34.010
will be legal for 12 continuous hours.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:37.940
Police, fire and hospital aid will be unavailable
until The Purge concludes.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:41.940
SECTION 3: The following weapons cannot be
used during The Purge: weapons of mass destruction,

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:47.350
fragment-producing explosives higher than
a hazard class HC/D 1.4 and viral contagion

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:48.350
projectiles.

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:51.810
SECTION 4: Government officials of ranking
5 and higher have been granted immunity from

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:53.810
The Purge and shall not be harmed.

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:57.270
SECTION 5: Non-compliance with any of the
aforementioned rules will result in death

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:58.270
by hanging.

00:14:58.270 --> 00:15:01.589
It’s never stated why The Purge takes place
at night, but it's probably as simple as the

00:15:01.589 --> 00:15:05.920
fact that crime is more likely to take place
under the cover of darkness, and the NFFA

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:09.130
feels recording technology is good enough
to still be able to identify people in low

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.270
light conditions.

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:13.460
The weapon restrictions seem to have more
detail on the website, whereas the PSA in

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:16.430
each movie simply refers to weapons class
4 and lower.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:20.670
There are other rules that aren’t mentioned
in PSA or the initial iteration of the website,

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:23.230
like the fact that there’s a legal purging
age of 13.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:27.590
That is, you have to be 13 to Purge, but there’s
no age requirement for being purged.

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:32.140
For whatever reason, Purge travel is tax deductible,
but weapons and security aren’t, at least

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:33.140
not yet.

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:36.529
The immunity for government officials wasn’t
present for the Staten Island experiment,

00:15:36.529 --> 00:15:39.750
probably because there were no government
officials staying on the island for that Purge,

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.400
so it must have been instituted for the Nationwide
Experiment.

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:44.950
This restriction would continue to change
as time would go on.

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:48.520
The website mentions more of the same lies
we’ve already discussed but it also mentions

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:50.560
the organization’s plans for education.

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:53.399
“The future of our new America relies on
our children.

00:15:53.399 --> 00:15:56.420
Over the next four years, we will be working
with states to implement the Federal Purge

00:15:56.420 --> 00:16:01.310
Preparation Program (PPP) in all public schools,
as we believe a quality education is necessary

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:04.060
for our youth to become the contributing citizens
of tomorrow.”

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:08.000
I already mentioned how The NFFA wants to
brainwash the next generation of kids by making

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.140
them believe that Purging is important to
their well being.

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:14.390
It’s also around this time that the NFFA
fund propaganda filled children’s programming,

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:17.910
teaching children that The Purge is a holiday
to help grown-ups get their worries out.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:22.170
“By giving them one night, to do whatever
they want!”

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:24.720
“Blessed be our New Founding Fathers.

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:29.529
And America, a nation reborn.”

00:16:29.529 --> 00:16:33.810
As I mentioned the blue baptisia flower had
become a symbol of this rebirth, so in 2018,

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:37.230
they would officially designate it as a sign
of support for The Purge, resulting in hundreds

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:39.420
of thousands of people displaying them in
their yards.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:43.399
With a few purges now having taken place,
America’s population went down, causing

00:16:43.399 --> 00:16:46.080
the NFFA to introduce their immigration policy.

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:49.010
This policy uses more tricky language to mislead
people.

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:52.920
It allowed for open borders, but not really
because they say those deemed undesirable

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.060
by the populace will be purged as such.

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:59.360
There had already been accusations of racial
inequality by the NFFA during the Staten Island

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:03.270
Experiment, because the demographics of the
neighborhoods that were hardest hit had darker

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:06.240
skin, but this new immigration policy pretty
much confirmed it.

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:08.900
In 2019, something called The Great Integration
occurred.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:12.910
“Led by the NFA, it eliminated party-line
bickering and established the highest political

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:16.050
consensus since the nation's first hours of
independence.”

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:20.209
There was also a law called the Contributing
Citizens Provision of 2019 which as I mentioned

00:17:20.209 --> 00:17:23.780
earlier, appears to ban discrimination, but
contains the caveat that they must be what

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:26.010
the NFFA defines as contributing citizens.

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:30.179
The year 2020 saw the establishment of the
Purge Injury and Disability Act.

00:17:30.179 --> 00:17:33.220
Their take on healthcare is very similar to
their take on civil rights.

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:36.990
They plan to provide healthcare, but only
to those who don’t really need that much

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:37.990
healthcare.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:41.750
This is a money saving scheme, which impacts
those with disabilities and those with injuries,

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.420
especially if they can’t afford treatment
of their own.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:48.521
A big kicker is that there is only one area
that’s truly immune to the Purge: the hospital.

00:17:48.521 --> 00:17:52.010
The desire to only permit the survival of
those who fit their view of what a perfect

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:55.860
ideal human looks like is very similar to
the Nazi’s idea of only having a single

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:56.860
Arian race.

00:17:56.860 --> 00:18:01.380
We’ve already seen them working with the
KKK and the NFFA would also attract Neo-Nazis

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:02.680
for those same reasons.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:05.970
Twenty-twenty was also the year that a bill
was introduced to the The US Senate that would

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:08.353
extend the length of The Purge from 12 hours
to 18 hours.

00:18:08.353 --> 00:18:11.809
Despite several years of trying, this bill
was never passed, though I should note that

00:18:11.809 --> 00:18:15.680
the NFFA dominated the senate at this point,
as this was after the Great Integration, so

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:18.990
the bill was being debated within the New
Founding Fathers party.

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:22.510
Senator Charles Bixby from California was
one of the politicians that supported the

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:25.030
extension, while Roger Ellis from TX opposed
it.

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:29.130
They continued their conquest to brainwash
the youth in 2021 with the American Historical

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:33.180
Act, which legally ensured that all students
be taught the history and perspective necessary

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:37.790
to -- as they put it -- understand the pre-Purge
ills which nearly collapsed this great nation.

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:41.220
Basically, they’re going to make sure that
all schools tell their students that The Purge

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:44.850
saved the country, making it look like an
indisputable fact that the annual evening

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:47.070
of mayhem is actually a good thing.

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:50.280
“Well, we studied the history of tonight
in history…”

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:54.800
The time leading up to The Fifth Annual Purge
in 2022 would be some of the NFFA’s busiest

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:58.860
and most dastardly years, and they continued
to take action behind the scenes to manipulate

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.472
the American people.

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:13.900
By the conclusion of The Fourth Annual Purge
in 2021, the NFFA had a massive legion of

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:17.390
sheep-like followers that would listen to
anything they had to say just because it was

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:18.820
coming from the NFFA.

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:22.170
Whichever side you’re on, I’m sure you
think that probably sounds familiar.

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:25.480
The New Founding Fathers would take to the
internet to further push their agenda, by

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:28.690
taking great lengths to make the Purge seem
like a normal, patriotic holiday.

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:33.000
They post red, white and blue martini recipes
on their blog, and give out tips for an environmentally

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.110
friendly Purge.

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:37.500
Gotta give respect to them where due for sticking
with the environmentally friendly thing.

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:40.190
There aren’t too many evil organizations
that will do that for us.

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:43.260
They brag about their impressive numbers when
it comes to low unemployment.

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:47.260
The rate is down to 1%, but it’s not because
they fixed the economy, but rather because

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:49.960
the unemployed can’t afford to protect themselves
on Purge night.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:52.150
If they aren’t alive, they aren’t unemployed.

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:55.950
“An official report by the Founders Economic
Advisory projected that this year’s Purge

00:19:55.950 --> 00:20:00.400
could reduce unemployment to an unprecedented
low of 0.85%.”

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:04.210
They try to make it look like this is because
of new jobs created by the Purge preparation

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:08.040
industry, but remember, because of their 2019
provisions, the ones who need jobs under the

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:11.250
NFFA regime aren’t really the ones that
are getting those jobs.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:15.050
Thanks to their government intervention, and
thanks to their skewing of collected data,

00:20:15.050 --> 00:20:18.890
releasing the beast during The Purge was becoming
more and more popular, and the NFFA, backed

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:22.890
by the behemoths of the gun industry, always
have financial incentive to make it bigger.

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:27.021
They post tips on literally dressing to kill,
making their murder promoting propoganda seem

00:20:27.021 --> 00:20:29.360
as innocuous as a basic fashion blog.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:33.020
The blog also explores combat rituals from
other cultures in an attempt to make the United

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:36.160
States’ yearly night of legal violence seem
a little bit more normal.

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:40.040
They also try to convince people that science
says violence is essentially part of our DNA;

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:42.360
that it’s natural for us to want to release
our anger.

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:46.000
The study is conducted by Dr. Peter Buynak,
who I’ve theorized is under the thumb of

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:50.480
the NFFA, and after seeing the fate of Dr.
Updale, it’s easy to see why he might comply.

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:54.020
They also air his interviews on TV, giving
Americans the false impression that purging

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.730
will solve their problems.

00:20:55.730 --> 00:21:01.110
BUYNAK: “The countrywide catharsis creates psychological
stability, by letting us release the aggression

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:02.600
we all have inside of us.”

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:07.309
In Michigan the government re-uses a tactic
from Staten Island, offering $250 per purge

00:21:07.309 --> 00:21:11.049
bounty, but of course, only if you’re employed-full
time, they couldn’t have the homeless taking

00:21:11.049 --> 00:21:12.280
advantage of that.

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:16.120
Twenty-twenty-two also marked a fifth consecutive
year that crime rates went down, however,

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:19.250
those numbers may need to be taken with a
grain of salt seeing as how they come from

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:21.030
the New Founders Institute of Justice.

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:25.390
It seems that no organization is safe from
The New Founding Fathers’ reach and corruption.

00:21:25.390 --> 00:21:26.551
Including the postal service.

00:21:26.551 --> 00:21:30.229
Imagine living in a world where the government tries to corrupt the postal service.

00:21:30.229 --> 00:21:34.130
If the numbers are to be believed though,
this is likely the height of the public’s

00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:37.650
support for The Purge with 88% supporting
the 28th amendment.

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:40.180
Finally the government immunity is decreased
for the next Purge.

00:21:40.180 --> 00:21:43.750
Where previously all officials of rank 5 and
above were granted immunity, now you would

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:47.420
have to rank at least 10 to receive immunity,
and no I don’t know what that means, but

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:50.840
I do know that US senators and anything higher
than that are still protected.

00:21:50.840 --> 00:21:54.940
When March 21st finally arrived, the Purge
once again received record participation.

00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:58.570
One family in California, which happens to
be the family of the security mogul I mentioned

00:21:58.570 --> 00:22:02.470
earlier, James Sandin, has a tumultuous Purge
night when their teenage son lets in a homeless

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:04.360
man being chased by a group of purgers.

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:07.840
They break in and ultimately, James and a
few of his neighbors lose their lives, but

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:12.080
the homeless man, Dante Bishop, is saved and
vows to put a stop to the NFFA.

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:15.970
That morning, hundreds of people gather in
Times Square for a public vigil to thank all

00:22:15.970 --> 00:22:19.299
those who were killed to make the country
a safer place, a demonstration of how the

00:22:19.299 --> 00:22:22.210
NFFA’s manipulation of public opinion is
working.

00:22:22.210 --> 00:22:26.150
But the markets continue to soar… at least
for gun and security system companies, which

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:28.970
of course, all benefits the dystopian political
party.

00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:31.970
They would put this newfound income to use
in their marketing department.

00:22:31.970 --> 00:22:35.960
As part of an attempt to seamlessly intertwine
their party and The Purge with American culture,

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:38.820
they revamp their website and release a line
of Purge paraphernalia.

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:41.880
We’re talking shirts, hats, bumper stickers
and koozies.

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:45.760
I know I’m not supposed to talk about real
politics, so I’ll just say, wowwww this

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:46.760
was accurate!

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:50.160
They also try to get in with the pop-culture
crowd by working with Hollywood star Lacey

00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:51.160
Demontgomery.

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:55.240
Her interview appeared in a January 2023 Issue
of We Weekly Magazine, where she discussed

00:22:55.240 --> 00:22:56.610
her plans for the upcoming Purge.

00:22:56.610 --> 00:23:00.799
They also do their weapon manufacturer friends
a favor by publishing a list of the Top 5

00:23:00.799 --> 00:23:04.760
gadgets for purging, the most unsettling of
which is an app called Finders Keepers that

00:23:04.760 --> 00:23:08.980
can monitor the GPS location of any cell phone
that is turned on during The Purge, making

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:12.660
it easy for purgers to find and kill their
enemies or friends.

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:16.570
One of the most deceptive political tactics
used by the NFFA is making the public feel

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:21.120
like they’re in control, when in fact, they
could not be more subjected to near totalitarian

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:22.120
rule.

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:25.290
We saw that in 2016, when they allowed Staten
Island to vote on if they wanted to host The

00:23:25.290 --> 00:23:28.580
Purge Experiment, and we see it again, as
they allow their followers to go online to

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:31.270
vote on potential new measures to add to the
Purge.

00:23:31.270 --> 00:23:34.760
However, if you read them, you may notice
that these are all measures that benefit the

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:36.940
NFFA with one possible exception.

00:23:36.940 --> 00:23:40.919
I’ll list them from most popular to least
popular and explain how they help the NFFA

00:23:40.919 --> 00:23:42.500
and harm the average citizen.

00:23:42.500 --> 00:23:43.500
Measure D:

00:23:43.500 --> 00:23:45.760
Make Purge and Purge Security Expenses Tax
Deductible.

00:23:45.760 --> 00:23:49.090
This would encourage more spending on Purge
related items, which means these sellers can

00:23:49.090 --> 00:23:52.000
donate more money to the NFFA, making them
more powerful.

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:56.030
It would also probably cause prices to increase,
making it even harder for the poor to defend

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:57.030
themselves.

00:23:57.030 --> 00:23:59.790
Measure C: Raise the Legal Purging Age from
13 to 16.

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:03.780
Thirteen to fifteen year olds make up about
19% of fatalities on Purge night.

00:24:03.780 --> 00:24:07.650
It benefits the NFFA for them to survive long
enough to buy their own weapons.

00:24:07.650 --> 00:24:11.370
Since they can’t work until they’re at
least 16, the older demographic is more likely

00:24:11.370 --> 00:24:12.610
to purchase a gun.

00:24:12.610 --> 00:24:15.610
Measure G: Allow State Governments To Pass
Local Purge Laws.

00:24:15.610 --> 00:24:18.780
This is the one exception that I mentioned,
but it could also benefit the NFFA

00:24:18.780 --> 00:24:22.719
if it means they’re able to pass new legislation
faster without having to go through the federal

00:24:22.719 --> 00:24:23.219
government.

00:24:23.219 --> 00:24:25.470
Measure F: Loosen Weapon Restrictions.

00:24:25.470 --> 00:24:27.179
More weapons, more purging.

00:24:27.179 --> 00:24:28.610
Measure E: Ban disguises.

00:24:28.610 --> 00:24:32.310
This would make it easier for the eyes in
the sky to find enemies of the NFFA so they

00:24:32.310 --> 00:24:33.460
can be taken out.

00:24:33.460 --> 00:24:37.466
Measure B: Replace The Failed Social Security
Scheme With A Contribution-based Purge Pension

00:24:37.466 --> 00:24:37.966
Plan.

00:24:37.966 --> 00:24:41.850
This reduces the NFFA spending on the elderly,
who they don’t care about because they’re

00:24:41.850 --> 00:24:43.169
unlikely to purge.

00:24:43.169 --> 00:24:45.450
And Measure A: Extend the Annual Purge Hours.

00:24:45.450 --> 00:24:47.790
A longer purge means more purging can take
place.

00:24:47.790 --> 00:24:51.549
It’s not known if any of these measures
were ever put into law, but the New Founding

00:24:51.549 --> 00:24:55.425
Fathers’ next venture world see them for
the first time meddling in the video game

00:24:55.425 --> 00:24:56.431
industry.

00:25:05.150 --> 00:25:08.670
In the months leading up to the sixth annual
Purge, shooting galleries were crowded with

00:25:08.670 --> 00:25:12.100
people looking to get some practice in before
the big night, leading many to try to find

00:25:12.100 --> 00:25:13.679
alternative forms of practice.

00:25:13.679 --> 00:25:17.720
Brown University did a study on the effect
of video games on handgun accuracy, and found

00:25:17.720 --> 00:25:22.000
that first person shooters can help improve
a person’s aim and response time by 15%

00:25:22.000 --> 00:25:23.100
and 30% respectively.

00:25:23.100 --> 00:25:27.420
The New Founding Fathers ran with this idea,
publicising the stats to help encourage gamers

00:25:27.420 --> 00:25:29.154
to rise up on Purge night.

00:25:29.789 --> 00:25:37.800
"You don't seem to understand, that there are skills that CS:GO teaches you that school just can't teach!"

00:25:37.800 --> 00:25:40.480
There’s also a Purge arcade game that goes
into development.

00:25:40.480 --> 00:25:44.799
It’s not entirely clear to what extent the
NFFA is involved, but you just know they probably

00:25:44.799 --> 00:25:47.450
had a hand in anything that glorifies The
Purge.

00:25:47.450 --> 00:25:50.520
Such as this Purge student art initiative
backed by the wife of New Founding Father

00:25:50.520 --> 00:25:55.320
J Adams Swift, where a 4th grader won $1,000
for writing a haiku that promoted the Purge.

00:25:55.320 --> 00:25:59.230
The final statement the group made before
the 2023 Purge was in response to a group

00:25:59.230 --> 00:26:02.970
of internet videos created by a resistance
fighter named Carmelo Johns claiming that

00:26:02.970 --> 00:26:05.830
his group would be fighting back against the
NFFA this year.

00:26:05.830 --> 00:26:09.799
The NFFA falsely claimed that they'd investigated
this threat, and found that the video traced

00:26:09.799 --> 00:26:12.419
back to a lone individual, not an organization.

00:26:12.419 --> 00:26:15.450
The reason they claimed that the rebellion
was a hoax was to discourage any of their

00:26:15.450 --> 00:26:18.820
opponents to try to join it and to fit their
narrative that The Purge is a good thing for

00:26:18.820 --> 00:26:21.059
the country, a now beloved holiday tradition.

00:26:21.059 --> 00:26:25.460
As they have since the Staten Island experiment
seven years before, The NFFA would send their

00:26:25.460 --> 00:26:29.020
own people out into this year’s Purge to
supplement the purging, however, things get

00:26:29.020 --> 00:26:32.650
out of hand in Los Angeles, where Carmelo
Johns and his men take out an entire truck

00:26:32.650 --> 00:26:34.300
full of the NFFA’s mercenaries.

00:26:34.300 --> 00:26:38.970
An ex-cop named Leo Barnes also gives them
trouble, taking out several NFFA hired purgers

00:26:38.970 --> 00:26:41.260
and saving four would-be victims.

00:26:41.260 --> 00:26:45.120
To make matters worse, Johns hacks into the
NFFA’s Purge countdown stream at the halfway

00:26:45.120 --> 00:26:49.010
point and delivers a message about the true
purpose of The Purge.

00:26:49.010 --> 00:26:53.771
“Profit making is not the essence of democracy.

00:26:53.771 --> 00:26:54.945
Wake up people.

00:26:54.945 --> 00:26:55.945
Wake up!

00:26:56.352 --> 00:26:57.592
It’s time to take a stand.

00:26:57.592 --> 00:27:01.183
Tonight we write our message in blood!”

00:27:01.183 --> 00:27:05.290
At the end of the night, the rebellion breaks
in to a Purge Gala where rich donors pay absurd

00:27:05.290 --> 00:27:08.559
amounts of money to hunt down homeless people
and other people who have been captured on

00:27:08.559 --> 00:27:10.370
the streets in a controlled environment.

00:27:10.370 --> 00:27:14.060
Johns, Dante Bishop, and several others spoil
the whole party, but outside of this hiccup

00:27:14.060 --> 00:27:17.851
in LA, the night is once again an overall
success for the administration in power, once

00:27:17.851 --> 00:27:20.010
again taking the title as the deadliest Purge.

00:27:20.010 --> 00:27:23.540
I was going to call it the purgiest purge
but that sounds kind of silly.

00:27:23.540 --> 00:27:27.340
But this may have been a contributing factor
to the opening of a Purge Memorial Park in

00:27:27.340 --> 00:27:30.230
Washington DC in Spring 2024.

00:27:30.230 --> 00:27:33.370
Citizens could order a brick to commemorate
their support for the NFFA or the loss of

00:27:33.370 --> 00:27:37.010
a loved one during the Purge -- yet another
grim example of the group using killing to

00:27:37.010 --> 00:27:38.510
drive sales and profits.

00:27:38.510 --> 00:27:42.000
They would eventually take this one step further
by instituting a yearly Remembrance Day to

00:27:42.000 --> 00:27:44.240
honor those who lost their lives during The
Purge.

00:27:44.240 --> 00:27:49.670
PSA: “This weekend is a time to honor and
celebrate those great martyrs, who gave their

00:27:49.670 --> 00:27:51.020
lives for our country.”

00:27:51.020 --> 00:27:53.290
Delivery Man: “Thank you for your sacrifice.”

00:27:53.290 --> 00:27:59.090
PSA: “Take time this holiday to remember,
there is no greater act of service, than to

00:27:59.090 --> 00:28:02.100
give your life for our great nation.”

00:28:02.100 --> 00:28:05.720
This subconsciously encourages people to go
out during the Purge, because if they do lose

00:28:05.720 --> 00:28:08.070
their lives, they can at least be remembered
as heroes.

00:28:08.070 --> 00:28:11.710
Remembrance Day would take place on June 21st,
three months after The Annual Purge.

00:28:11.710 --> 00:28:15.300
Over the next several years, the rebellion
is still working behind the scenes, but most

00:28:15.300 --> 00:28:18.669
of the country has basically begrudgingly
accepted The Purge as a part of life.

00:28:18.669 --> 00:28:22.220
In order to continue to prove to their supporters
that The Purge is “working” and to keep

00:28:22.220 --> 00:28:26.160
their detractors living in fear, the NFFA
must continue to find new ways to increase

00:28:26.160 --> 00:28:27.860
participation year after year.

00:28:27.860 --> 00:28:31.910
We’ve seen them tie The Purge into many
aspects of life, like pop-culture and religion,

00:28:31.910 --> 00:28:34.179
and it wouldn’t be long before it also leaked
into business.

00:28:34.179 --> 00:28:37.830
Since the NFFA’s policies help the rich
get richer, many of their biggest supporters

00:28:37.830 --> 00:28:41.040
are extremely wealthy and hold Purge night
parties where they get their biggest business

00:28:41.040 --> 00:28:45.020
deals of the year done, using the opportunity
to pressure their business partners into joining

00:28:45.020 --> 00:28:48.289
up with NFFA and maybe even do a little purging
themselves.

00:28:48.289 --> 00:28:51.780
On the flip side, it’s been well established
that the NFFA’s biggest targets are the

00:28:51.780 --> 00:28:53.140
homeless, sick and vulnerable.

00:28:53.140 --> 00:28:57.020
In other words, the people who require care
that requires government spending.

00:28:59.332 --> 00:29:03.400
“The NFFA doesn’t care about protecting
drug addicts and alcoholics.

00:29:03.400 --> 00:29:05.400
We have to lock down like everyone else.”

00:29:05.400 --> 00:29:09.230
But they aren’t just denying them protection
-- they’re also actively working on programs

00:29:09.230 --> 00:29:10.750
to see that these people are purged.

00:29:10.750 --> 00:29:15.010
In New Orleans, at some point they hired a
social worker named Tavis to form a sham-religion

00:29:15.010 --> 00:29:16.030
called The Mercy Cult.

00:29:16.030 --> 00:29:19.429
She would meet these recovering teens at their
lowest point and convince them that they can

00:29:19.429 --> 00:29:23.850
cleanse their souls and become Gods and Goddesses
by giving themselves up; by stepping out of

00:29:23.850 --> 00:29:25.511
their flesh to enter The Invisible.

00:29:25.511 --> 00:29:27.730
“Purify my flesh.

00:29:27.730 --> 00:29:29.061
Prepare my soul.

00:29:29.061 --> 00:29:30.239
The giving is near.

00:29:30.239 --> 00:29:31.620
The invisible awaits.”

00:29:31.620 --> 00:29:36.900
She convinces them that their souls are irreparably
damaged by the drug use, and giving their lives is the only

00:29:36.900 --> 00:29:38.500
way to cleanse themselves.

00:29:38.500 --> 00:29:41.960
These kids were also easy targets, because
having just come out of rehab, they would

00:29:41.960 --> 00:29:46.210
have no access to the caregivers they had
grown accustomed to, so they were even more inclined

00:29:46.210 --> 00:29:50.090
to find something else to lean on, someone
who seemed to care for them.

00:29:50.090 --> 00:29:53.919
“I will be your guide into the invisible.

00:29:53.919 --> 00:29:56.780
Where there is no pain, only love.

00:29:56.780 --> 00:30:01.100
Tavis dubbed herself as the “Good Leader”
of the cult and created a whole program where

00:30:01.100 --> 00:30:03.919
she would teach the kids how to prepare themselves
for The Invisible.

00:30:03.919 --> 00:30:07.220
Once they got older and reached their late
teens, they would graduate from yellow robes

00:30:07.220 --> 00:30:11.440
to light blue ones that matched the official
color of the NFFA and the blue baptisias that

00:30:11.440 --> 00:30:13.380
represent rebirth or baptism.

00:30:13.380 --> 00:30:16.929
On the eve of their “giving”, they are
to shower, another symbol of the cleanse.

00:30:16.929 --> 00:30:19.980
They spend the afternoon joining together
in prayer, then she leads them to a light

00:30:19.980 --> 00:30:20.980
blue school bus.

00:30:20.980 --> 00:30:23.020
But this was no game of Fortnite.

00:30:23.020 --> 00:30:26.850
Every Purge, the bus would travel around the
city, making several stops, and at each one,

00:30:26.850 --> 00:30:29.980
the cult would chant in prayer as Tavis would
“select” one victim.

00:30:29.980 --> 00:30:33.730
She would pretend to be some kind of shaman
who could receive messages from The Invisible

00:30:33.730 --> 00:30:35.900
telling her whose turn it was at each stop.

00:30:35.900 --> 00:30:39.350
Then, that person would get off the bus, where
a group of purgers was waiting, and the rest

00:30:39.350 --> 00:30:42.549
of the group would watch as the person is
either purged or taken somewhere where they

00:30:42.549 --> 00:30:43.730
would later be purged.

00:30:43.730 --> 00:30:47.730
It’s not known exactly how long Tavis ran
this cult or how many innocent teens lost

00:30:47.730 --> 00:30:51.490
their lives as a result of this, but it comes
to an end during the 10th Annual Purge in

00:30:51.490 --> 00:30:52.490
2027.

00:30:52.490 --> 00:30:54.961
Actually, it seems they weren’t entirely
sure about the date with this stuff, but it

00:30:54.961 --> 00:30:59.170
makes more sense that this document would
be a mistake than the computer for their security

00:30:59.170 --> 00:31:00.170
system being wrong.

00:31:00.170 --> 00:31:03.850
Anyway, a Marine named Miguel Guerrero comes
home looking for his sister and tracks down

00:31:03.850 --> 00:31:05.040
The Mercy Cult bus.

00:31:05.040 --> 00:31:09.100
Tavis’s affiliation with the NFFA is exposed,
and she falls victim to The Purge.

00:31:09.100 --> 00:31:13.520
However, this was most likely just one chapter
in of this cult in one city, so it was probably

00:31:13.520 --> 00:31:17.580
just a small L for the New Founding Fathers,
not a total victory royale, but not a bad

00:31:17.580 --> 00:31:18.580
finish either.

00:31:18.580 --> 00:31:22.700
The next known activity occurs during the
19th annual Purge, when an NFFA surveillance

00:31:22.700 --> 00:31:27.833
agent named Esme Carmona notices some strange
activity in District 2 of New Orleans.

00:31:37.250 --> 00:31:41.650
While on the lookout for illegal activity
during the 19th Purge on March 22nd, 2036

00:31:41.650 --> 00:31:45.960
Esme Carmona notices a professor that she
knows, out during The Purge, which she finds

00:31:45.960 --> 00:31:47.190
very strange.

00:31:49.982 --> 00:31:51.657
ESME: “Oh no.

00:31:51.709 --> 00:31:52.879
That’s Drew Adams.”

00:31:53.108 --> 00:31:54.796
VIVIAN: “You know her?

00:31:54.796 --> 00:31:56.170
ESME: “She h*ted this holiday.

00:31:56.170 --> 00:31:57.850
She wouldn’t be outside.”

00:31:57.850 --> 00:32:02.169
If you're wondering how I know it's the 2036
Purge, it has to be after 2032, because there's

00:32:02.169 --> 00:32:05.700
a 14 year flashback to another Purge, and
based on how the characters act, it isn't

00:32:05.700 --> 00:32:06.700
the first.

00:32:06.700 --> 00:32:11.310
But it has to be before 2037, because Ryan
uses an ID that expires in late 2036, and

00:32:11.310 --> 00:32:12.310
it works.

00:32:12.310 --> 00:32:16.740
There is no Saturday June 15 in that date
range, but there is a Saturday July 19th in

00:32:16.740 --> 00:32:17.740
2036.

00:32:17.740 --> 00:32:20.559
The “eyes in the sky” agents aren’t
supposed to bring personal relationships into

00:32:20.559 --> 00:32:24.820
their work, but Esme becomes obsessed after
watching her close friend get purged on camera,

00:32:24.820 --> 00:32:27.370
and decides to do some secret investigating
on her own.

00:32:27.370 --> 00:32:31.231
She discovers that Professor Adams’s home
was invaded by NFFA soldiers and comes to

00:32:31.231 --> 00:32:32.720
the conclusion that it wasn’t random.

00:32:32.720 --> 00:32:36.750
Her superior at the office realizes what she’s
up to and threatens to reprimand her if she

00:32:36.750 --> 00:32:37.750
doesn’t stop.

00:32:37.750 --> 00:32:42.880
“.... So take some time off, grieve for your friend,
then let it go.”

00:32:42.880 --> 00:32:47.330
So she uses the free time to take to the streets
to try to find out why her friend was targeted.

00:32:47.330 --> 00:32:50.780
She recovers some evidence from her house
that suggests she'd been conducting some kind

00:32:50.780 --> 00:32:53.730
of independent study on the human brain before
she was purged.

00:32:53.730 --> 00:32:56.820
Esme gets in contact with one of her students,
looking for answers.

00:32:56.820 --> 00:33:01.210
In June 2036, the student finds her that answer
when he reveals that Professor Adams was trying

00:33:01.210 --> 00:33:05.330
to hide her study, because it had found proof
that the NFFA had been lying about the effects

00:33:05.330 --> 00:33:07.020
of The Purge on human behaviour.

00:33:07.020 --> 00:33:11.120
Their behavioral scientist Dr. Peter Buynak had
concluded that Purging was a catharsis, that

00:33:11.120 --> 00:33:14.290
people could “let out” their aggression
and be fine for the rest of the year.

00:33:14.290 --> 00:33:17.550
Professor Adams’s study said the opposite,
claiming that engaging in violence will likely

00:33:17.550 --> 00:33:19.990
lead to the desire for more violent behaviour.

00:33:19.990 --> 00:33:25.150
“Those brain scans show that violent actions
can light up the pleasure centers of the brain

00:33:25.150 --> 00:33:26.550
like a drug.

00:33:26.550 --> 00:33:29.480
Especially those in the younger generation,
those who grew up with the 28th amendment.

00:33:29.480 --> 00:33:33.679
I’d like to point out AGAIN that The Purge
is a work of fiction, and I do not know if

00:33:33.679 --> 00:33:37.669
Prof. Adams or Dr. Buynak's findings are true;
and to be honest, I’m not going down that

00:33:37.669 --> 00:33:38.940
rabbit hole in this video.

00:33:38.940 --> 00:33:42.850
They speculate that everything the NFFA has
been saying about crime rates going down after

00:33:42.850 --> 00:33:45.350
the institution of The Purge may have been
false data.

00:33:45.350 --> 00:33:49.580
Esme realizes she could find Professor Adams’s
anonymous test subjects using the facial recognition

00:33:49.580 --> 00:33:51.070
technology at her job.

00:33:51.070 --> 00:33:54.510
This would be risky, because she’s not supposed
to use the equipment for personal reasons,

00:33:54.510 --> 00:33:56.860
but it would help her verify the results of
the study.

00:33:56.860 --> 00:34:00.880
Esme’s boss notices her transgressions and
begins spying on her every move with the interests

00:34:00.880 --> 00:34:03.169
of protecting the NFFA’s dirty secrets.

00:34:03.169 --> 00:34:05.760
He doesn't want them to be just another regret.

00:34:05.760 --> 00:34:06.840
I'm fired.

00:34:06.840 --> 00:34:10.349
This eventually causes her to have to go on
the run from the law in November as she continued

00:34:10.349 --> 00:34:11.349
her investigation.

00:34:11.349 --> 00:34:15.139
All but one of Professor Adams’s test subjects
were taken out along with her during the 19th

00:34:15.139 --> 00:34:19.700
Purge, and that one that they couldn’t get
to was illegally killed off-purge by the NFFA,

00:34:19.700 --> 00:34:20.700
and it was covered up.

00:34:20.700 --> 00:34:24.419
So essentially, when Carmelo Johns and Dante
Bishop started the anti-NFFA revolution 13

00:34:24.419 --> 00:34:28.079
years before, they only knew about half of
the sins the party had committed.

00:34:28.079 --> 00:34:31.760
The reason they were able to stay in power
so long was because they were using The Purge

00:34:31.760 --> 00:34:33.740
to take out anyone who might threaten their
regime.

00:34:33.740 --> 00:34:37.059
So the Purge wasn’t just a way for them
to make money by killing the groups they don’t

00:34:37.059 --> 00:34:41.379
like, but it was also the single biggest factor
contributing to keeping them in power.

00:34:41.379 --> 00:34:44.309
Esme is able to navigate the street to learn
all of this, because she knows where all the

00:34:44.309 --> 00:34:45.779
dead zones are with no cameras.

00:34:45.779 --> 00:34:47.819
However, she’s not able to evade them forever.

00:34:47.819 --> 00:34:51.520
She dodges a taser from an undercover FBI
agent, which hilariously hits a random woman,

00:34:51.520 --> 00:34:55.940
and Esme goes on the run with her entire former
workplace trying to track her movements.

00:34:55.940 --> 00:34:59.109
“We worked side by side with Esme.

00:34:59.109 --> 00:35:00.779
She was part of our family.

00:35:00.779 --> 00:35:06.210
But she has committed an act of treason, and
now it is our job to protect this country,

00:35:06.210 --> 00:35:07.210
by catching her.”

00:35:07.210 --> 00:35:11.970
The search for Esme becomes a priority-1 manhunt,
meaning that the higher powers of the NFFA

00:35:11.970 --> 00:35:15.599
have given the visual analytics team access
to private cell phone cameras in an attempt

00:35:15.599 --> 00:35:16.920
to locate her faster.

00:35:16.920 --> 00:35:20.280
She does have one friend on the inside though
-- a woman who worked at the desk behind her

00:35:20.280 --> 00:35:21.280
named Vivian.

00:35:21.280 --> 00:35:24.770
Esme tries blending into what appears to be
a crowd of riled up sports fans, but one of

00:35:24.770 --> 00:35:29.559
their cell phones captures her face, and the
area is soon surrounded by armed NFFA SWAT

00:35:29.559 --> 00:35:30.559
guys.

00:35:30.559 --> 00:35:33.270
She slips away to hide out in a warehouse
owned by this guy she kind of knows.

00:35:33.270 --> 00:35:36.969
His name is Ryan Grant, and he’s an ex-cop
who now robs banks during The Purge.

00:35:36.969 --> 00:35:40.410
He gives her a place to lie low for a while
in exchange for her helping him out on his

00:35:40.410 --> 00:35:43.760
next heist with her inside knowledge of how
the NFFA operates.

00:35:43.760 --> 00:35:47.549
Meanwhile, Esme brainstorms on how she’s
going to expose Professor Adams’s research

00:35:47.549 --> 00:35:48.549
to the public.

00:35:48.549 --> 00:35:51.074
“The NFFA just issued an alert.

00:35:51.074 --> 00:35:54.668
All citizens should be on the lookout for
Esme Carmona.

00:35:56.345 --> 00:35:59.539
Looks like you’re public enemy number 1.”

00:35:59.539 --> 00:36:03.450
I’m just gonna assume that he manually removed
all the cameras from that phone and didn't

00:36:03.450 --> 00:36:07.020
stupidly give her up to the NFFA by pointing
them at her.

00:36:07.020 --> 00:36:08.020
Right?

00:36:08.020 --> 00:36:09.560
That must be what happened??

00:36:09.560 --> 00:36:10.560
Please?

00:36:10.560 --> 00:36:13.579
She helps Ryan and his team perfect their
bank heist plan for the next Purge, and Vivian

00:36:13.579 --> 00:36:15.759
fills her in on what’s going on at the surveillance
center.

00:36:15.759 --> 00:36:19.329
The eyes in the sky expect Esme to make her
move on Purge night, so everyone is alerted

00:36:19.329 --> 00:36:20.420
to look out for her.

00:36:20.420 --> 00:36:24.509
When the big night arrives, Vivian and Esme
meet in secret 3 hours before commencement,

00:36:24.509 --> 00:36:28.660
and Emse asks her to falsely tag her in the
system in order to distract the NFFA and allow

00:36:28.660 --> 00:36:30.789
the real Esme some wiggle room to pull off
her plan.

00:36:31.094 --> 00:36:33.193
“That was a false hit on Esme.

00:36:33.193 --> 00:36:34.769
Strike team couldn’t find any sign of her.”

00:36:34.769 --> 00:36:35.769
“Oh.

00:36:35.769 --> 00:36:36.769
It looked like her.

00:36:36.769 --> 00:36:37.769
I’m sorry.

00:36:37.769 --> 00:36:38.829
I’m just anxious to bring her in.”

00:36:38.829 --> 00:36:42.979
Meanwhile, Esme sneaks off to a secret warehouse
full of hackers, who are standing by to amplify

00:36:42.979 --> 00:36:45.809
her message to as many screens as possible
when the time comes.

00:36:45.809 --> 00:36:49.069
They also use a deep fake hologram of Esme
to draw the guards of the surveillance center

00:36:49.069 --> 00:36:50.519
away from their posts.

00:36:50.935 --> 00:36:54.130
"Right now you are walking down a street near
that NFFA building and there is absolutely

00:36:54.130 --> 00:36:56.420
no way they can tell it’s fake.”

00:36:56.420 --> 00:36:57.420
It works.

00:36:57.420 --> 00:37:00.609
Esme’s former boss dispatches his first
floor security team as she sneaks up to the

00:37:00.609 --> 00:37:02.119
back door of the surveillance center.

00:37:02.119 --> 00:37:05.589
She uses a piece of technology known as a
jammer to basically knock out the power in

00:37:05.589 --> 00:37:06.589
the entire building.

00:37:06.589 --> 00:37:07.749
I know, kind of OP.

00:37:07.749 --> 00:37:11.660
Unfortunately this is the only time the existence
of jammers are acknowledged in the Purge universe

00:37:11.660 --> 00:37:12.660
so far.

00:37:12.660 --> 00:37:14.660
She has a 60 second window to break into the
building.

00:37:14.660 --> 00:37:18.089
Then she climbs up an IT tunnel to break into
the server room and access the footage of

00:37:18.089 --> 00:37:20.750
the NFFA breaking into an innocent woman's
house.

00:37:20.750 --> 00:37:24.469
The NFFA probably scrubbed the main surveillance
camera footage out of existence, but this

00:37:24.469 --> 00:37:28.096
is coming from dash cam footage on a postal
van that they are unlikely to know about.

00:37:28.096 --> 00:37:31.898
So she's basically using their Orwellian cameras-everywhere surveillance against them.

00:37:32.009 --> 00:37:35.089
She also discovers proof that they are killing
citizens off-Purge.

00:37:35.089 --> 00:37:37.990
She finds that they’ve stepped up their
security since her departure and the ability

00:37:37.990 --> 00:37:40.660
to transfer files off the servers has been
revoked.

00:37:40.660 --> 00:37:44.380
The monitors also have some kind of screenshot
blocking technology, so she improvises.

00:37:44.380 --> 00:37:48.970
“The file was protected, I couldn’t transfer
it outside the closed system.”

00:37:48.970 --> 00:37:51.180
“Don’t tell me this was all for nothing.”

00:37:51.180 --> 00:37:57.950
“I could transfer the file within the system,
so I did… to the broadcast room.”

00:37:57.950 --> 00:38:00.040
Vivian informs her that it’s way too risky.

00:38:00.040 --> 00:38:03.719
Once she started broadcasting, she’d essentially
be a sitting duck, and it was Purge, so there’s

00:38:03.719 --> 00:38:05.200
no telling what they might do to her.

00:38:05.200 --> 00:38:07.922
But that’s a risk that Esme is willing to
take.

00:38:17.109 --> 00:38:20.019
Vivian does her part by creating a distraction
for her fellow co-workers.

00:38:20.019 --> 00:38:22.609
Or at least… trying to create a distraction.

00:38:22.609 --> 00:38:23.609
“Uh, everyone.

00:38:23.609 --> 00:38:24.609
Uhm.

00:38:24.609 --> 00:38:25.609
Everybody.

00:38:25.609 --> 00:38:30.369
I just, uhm, I just want to say thank you
for making my first yea here…

00:38:30.369 --> 00:38:32.650
YEAR* here, so wonderful…

00:38:32.650 --> 00:38:35.854
And uhm, let’s not miss anything this year.

00:38:36.663 --> 00:38:38.663
Thank you..."

00:38:39.308 --> 00:38:41.308
ASSASSIN'S CREED MERCHANT: "That won't happen here!"

00:38:41.624 --> 00:38:43.400
ASSASSIN'S CREED MERCHANT: "Where is the one responsible for this?!"

00:38:43.400 --> 00:38:46.989
Needless to say, one of them reports the sus
activity to the boss and he intercepts Esme

00:38:46.989 --> 00:38:48.289
and Vivian in the stairwell.

00:38:48.289 --> 00:38:52.528
Vivian takes the bullet for Esme, who promptly
strikes back before infiltrating the broadcast room.

00:38:52.528 --> 00:38:56.849
This causes sirens to sound all over the building
and practically an army of guards to swarm

00:38:56.849 --> 00:39:00.200
Esme, but with the added assistance of Ryan,
who shows up to save her, she’s able to

00:39:00.200 --> 00:39:02.802
stay alive just long enough to get her message
out to the world.

00:39:02.802 --> 00:39:11.457
ESME: "You know what she found? Proof that Purge doesn’t take away our anger,
our h*tred and our fears.

00:39:11.660 --> 00:39:13.769
It fuels them.

00:39:13.769 --> 00:39:18.869
The reason I’m being hunted, is because
I discovered the truth.”

00:39:18.869 --> 00:39:23.190
Esme shows the video just as The Purge ends,
and even though she should theoretically be

00:39:23.190 --> 00:39:27.390
safe until next year's Purge, the NFFA takes
her out, once again proving her claim that

00:39:27.390 --> 00:39:28.660
they’re taking out their opponents off-Purge.

00:39:28.660 --> 00:39:33.430
However, what that officer didn’t realize
was that Esme never took the broadcast off

00:39:33.430 --> 00:39:34.430
the air.

00:39:34.430 --> 00:39:35.792
It became the shot heard round…

00:39:36.123 --> 00:39:36.970
New Orleans...

00:39:36.970 --> 00:39:40.180
The NFFA would try to calm down the public
by making the claim that what happened on

00:39:40.180 --> 00:39:42.050
that broadcast was all fake news.

00:39:42.050 --> 00:39:45.141
This was enough to convince a good amount
of their supporters, but more than ever, people

00:39:45.141 --> 00:39:46.519
were waking up to their lies.

00:39:46.519 --> 00:39:50.400
I really am tired of the whole "wake up people"
cliche, but I couldn't think of a better word

00:39:50.400 --> 00:39:51.829
to say right there… so...

00:39:51.829 --> 00:39:55.339
As usual, the Purge death toll is as high
as it ever has been, but more and more people

00:39:55.339 --> 00:39:59.810
are realizing that many of these deaths aren’t
the result of PvP kills, or in this case,

00:39:59.810 --> 00:40:01.089
citizen on citizen purging.

00:40:01.089 --> 00:40:05.759
Two months later, in April of 2037, Vivian,
who somehow survived the 20th Annual Purge,

00:40:05.759 --> 00:40:09.279
joined the resistance, which is bigger than
ever thanks to Esme’s contributions.

00:40:09.279 --> 00:40:13.289
The American citizens are getting angrier
and angrier, and for the first time in years,

00:40:13.289 --> 00:40:16.109
new independent politicians are getting support
in the polls.

00:40:16.109 --> 00:40:19.789
This political tension would reach a breaking
point in 2040.

00:40:21.517 --> 00:40:26.930
“This is just one of a dozen protests around
our capital after reports emerged claiming

00:40:26.930 --> 00:40:32.229
that the New Founding Fathers had been using
the Purge to help their own economic agenda.”

00:40:32.229 --> 00:40:36.990
The Presidential Office is up for re-election
once again, and as usual, an NFFA candidate

00:40:36.990 --> 00:40:39.950
is the favorite, but this time not by a very
wide margin.

00:40:39.950 --> 00:40:46.049
“Establishment NFFA candidate Minister Edwidge
Owens has been losing ground to wildcard Independent

00:40:46.049 --> 00:40:48.240
candidate Senator Charlie Roan.”

00:40:48.240 --> 00:40:50.890
Roan’s campaign rides on her promise to
put an end to The Purge.

00:40:50.890 --> 00:40:54.279
During an emergency meeting at the White House,
the incumbent President Caleb Warrens expresses

00:40:54.279 --> 00:40:56.109
his concern about senator Roan’s chances.

00:40:56.109 --> 00:41:00.119
He announces his disgust with the public,
calling them “idealistic pigs” and claiming

00:41:00.119 --> 00:41:04.390
that not everyone in a society can have it
all -- there simply isn’t enough to go around.

00:41:04.390 --> 00:41:08.519
He stands before them, in his $20M board room,
and proclaims that it’s time to do something

00:41:08.519 --> 00:41:11.839
about the NFFA’s detractors, like Bishop
and Roan.

00:41:11.839 --> 00:41:19.922
“We are going to use this year’s Purge
to do some Spring cleaning gentlemen…”

00:41:21.294 --> 00:41:23.480
Day 9429.

00:41:23.480 --> 00:41:27.099
They still have not realized that I’m not
one of the boys.

00:41:27.099 --> 00:41:30.749
Section 4 of the 28th amendment would see
yet another change, this time with the immunity

00:41:30.749 --> 00:41:33.050
for government officials being removed altogether.

00:41:33.050 --> 00:41:37.039
When the NFFA Press Secretary Tommy Roseland
presents this news, he tries to make it about

00:41:37.039 --> 00:41:38.039
fairness.

00:41:38.039 --> 00:41:41.059
His reasoning for removing the exemption is
to even the playing field, so the rich and

00:41:41.059 --> 00:41:43.469
powerful are on the same level as the average
citizen.

00:41:43.469 --> 00:41:46.709
However, it’s clear to Roan’s administration
that this is really all about purging her

00:41:46.709 --> 00:41:48.859
out of the picture so they can easily take
the election.

00:41:48.859 --> 00:41:51.950
It’s not like the rich and powerful elite
still won’t be able to use their money to

00:41:51.950 --> 00:41:54.270
protect themselves, just like they have every
year.

00:41:54.270 --> 00:41:56.529
The next debate does well for Senator Roan.

00:41:56.529 --> 00:41:59.930
Minister Owens announces he’ll be presiding
over his party’s Midnight Purge Mass, the

00:41:59.930 --> 00:42:03.819
next step in the evolution we’ve seen across
the NFFA’s history towards integrating The

00:42:03.819 --> 00:42:05.509
Purge into some kind of religion.

00:42:05.509 --> 00:42:08.920
Roan gains the sympathy of many voters by
caring for the low-income individuals who

00:42:08.920 --> 00:42:12.520
are the most endangered demographic during
The Purge, and spiteing the NFFA and their

00:42:12.520 --> 00:42:14.069
sponsors who benefit from it.

00:42:14.069 --> 00:42:18.579
By removing the exemption for government officials,
the NFFA has put Roan in a tough spot.

00:42:18.579 --> 00:42:21.780
She can either stay home, and risk being
purged, or she can lock herself up in a high

00:42:21.780 --> 00:42:25.910
security safehouse, making her look rich and
unrelatable to her low-income voter base,

00:42:25.910 --> 00:42:28.950
thus causing her to lose votes and probably
lose the election.

00:42:28.950 --> 00:42:33.440
So she decides to stay home, and let her security
detail line the inside of the house with guards.

00:42:33.440 --> 00:42:37.440
Unfortunately for her, this is exactly what
the NFFA was expecting, and they had men on

00:42:37.440 --> 00:42:38.440
the inside.

00:42:38.440 --> 00:42:42.410
I guess Eric and Chief Couper were New Founding
Fathers who took a job as part of Roan’s

00:42:42.410 --> 00:42:45.680
security team some time ago as an insurance
policy for the NFFA.

00:42:45.680 --> 00:42:48.959
Not sure how they got around the background
check, but I’ll just assume the NFFA have

00:42:48.959 --> 00:42:52.009
people in high places to where something like
a background check can easily be fabricated.

00:42:52.009 --> 00:42:56.390
Couper pulls a Saw 2 on the security cameras
so that they’re playing back recorded footage

00:42:56.390 --> 00:42:59.890
instead of a live feed, and Eric dismisses
two of the guards by the front door, so that

00:42:59.890 --> 00:43:02.770
nobody sees when all the men outside the house
are sniped down.

00:43:02.770 --> 00:43:07.134
He quietly disarms the security system and
lets the NFFA’s assassins into the senator’s

00:43:07.134 --> 00:43:07.972
home.

00:43:17.170 --> 00:43:21.450
This time the NFFA has hired a unit of neo-Nazi
henchmen, contuing the tradition of working

00:43:21.450 --> 00:43:24.569
with modern factions of the very worst groups
in human history.

00:43:24.569 --> 00:43:27.450
Many of the villains that I cover here on
Horror History have some kind of a gray area

00:43:27.450 --> 00:43:31.680
in their morality, but it's clear we're supposed
to see the NFFA as just pure evil.

00:43:31.680 --> 00:43:35.277
They sweep the lower level, then make their
way upstairs to the den when Roan is being kept.

00:43:35.277 --> 00:43:38.779
Eric has all the security credentials to get
them into the room, but when they arrive,

00:43:38.779 --> 00:43:41.970
they discover that she’s already escaped with
her head security guard, Leo Barnes.

00:43:41.970 --> 00:43:46.400
The leader of the assassins is Earl Danzinger,
a mercenary covered from literal head to toe

00:43:46.400 --> 00:43:47.779
in the symbols of terrorist groups.

00:43:47.779 --> 00:43:51.490
He tells his men that Roan and Barnes may
be outside and has them check the perimeter,

00:43:51.490 --> 00:43:54.200
but not long after, they are spotted by Couper
from the window.

00:43:54.200 --> 00:43:57.359
One of the snipers, Tommy, fires at them,
and manages to hit Barnes in the shoulder

00:43:57.359 --> 00:44:01.420
with a tracking bullet, but he has a clever
counter-attack, detonating a remote bomb he

00:44:01.420 --> 00:44:05.680
left behind in the room that takes out everyone
besides Tommy, who barely survives and loses

00:44:05.680 --> 00:44:09.049
consciousness; Danzinger, who had already
stepped outside; and the men who were already

00:44:09.049 --> 00:44:10.479
outside searching the perimeter.

00:44:10.479 --> 00:44:14.739
I’m guessing that qualifies as higher than
a class 4 explosive, but obeying The Purge’s

00:44:14.739 --> 00:44:18.459
rules was probably the least of their concerns
right now, plus Roan could always pardon him

00:44:18.459 --> 00:44:19.969
after she’s won the election.

00:44:19.969 --> 00:44:22.880
Danzinger orders his men to search the streets
while he searches the skies.

00:44:22.880 --> 00:44:26.380
I think at this point they don’t realize
that the tracking bullet actually stuck in

00:44:26.380 --> 00:44:28.950
Leo’s shoulder, so they don’t think to
check that right away.

00:44:28.950 --> 00:44:32.559
Danzinger commands his men from the helicopter,
when he receives word that Tommy regained

00:44:32.559 --> 00:44:33.559
consciousness.

00:44:33.559 --> 00:44:35.859
Tommy lets them know about the tracking bullet,
so from that point they’re able to find

00:44:35.859 --> 00:44:38.450
him and the senator fairly quickly, and shoot
at the triage van they’re traveling in from

00:44:38.450 --> 00:44:39.950
the chopper.

00:44:39.950 --> 00:44:43.549
They circle back around for another round,
but the van turns unexpectedly and hides under

00:44:43.549 --> 00:44:46.650
the freeway, which suggests to Danzinger that
she’s probably still alive.

00:44:47.615 --> 00:44:48.976
“We’re gonna lose em under there.

00:44:49.662 --> 00:44:50.662
Ground unit.

00:44:50.662 --> 00:44:53.868
Get you ***es moving and get here now, we’ve got
them cornered.”

00:44:53.868 --> 00:44:55.819
The ground unit follows the location of the
bullet.

00:44:55.819 --> 00:44:59.410
They take the truck as far as they can, then
go on foot to the waterfront, where they find

00:44:59.410 --> 00:45:01.239
the bullet discarded on the ground.

00:45:01.239 --> 00:45:05.151
Just as they realize they’ve been hoodwinked,
bamboozled, led astray, ruck amok, and flat

00:45:05.151 --> 00:45:08.999
out deceived, they’re also ambushed by an
aggressive group of gang members, and the

00:45:08.999 --> 00:45:12.509
last thing Danzinger hears from them over
the headset is gunshots, and the celebration

00:45:12.509 --> 00:45:13.509
of their defeat.

00:45:13.509 --> 00:45:17.109
He commands his people to search every traffic
cam in the city to find the triage van.

00:45:17.109 --> 00:45:19.901
Later that night, they find it, and at the
request of minister Edwidge Owens, capture

00:45:19.901 --> 00:45:21.220
the senator alive.

00:45:21.220 --> 00:45:25.000
They bring her to the Our Lady of Sorrow church,
but they were not there to solve the mystery

00:45:25.000 --> 00:45:29.420
of laceration gravity, but rather to sacrifice
Senator Roan in the holiest way they know

00:45:29.420 --> 00:45:31.609
how at Midnight Purge Mass.

00:45:31.609 --> 00:45:34.740
Once inside the cathedral, she’s knocked
unconscious and dressed in a white gown, to

00:45:34.740 --> 00:45:38.200
be presented to Edwidge Owens and the rest
of the NFFA congregation.

00:45:38.200 --> 00:45:42.329
Together they recite the NFFA anthem and Owens
gives a sermon, with a little bit of a psychotic

00:45:42.329 --> 00:45:43.329
energy.

00:45:43.329 --> 00:45:50.739
“We’ll sin, scour, sanitize and sterilize
our souls, until we are free again!

00:45:50.739 --> 00:45:53.339
And this country will be better for it!”

00:45:53.339 --> 00:45:56.849
The first purge of the evening is a martyr
named Lawrence, who Owens notes was a lifelong

00:45:56.849 --> 00:46:00.950
drug addict, to keep the NFFA on brand with
their desire to purge those who may require

00:46:00.950 --> 00:46:02.380
government assistance.

00:46:02.380 --> 00:46:06.109
Roan is brought out to be the next victim,
the most ceremonious one of the evening.

00:46:06.109 --> 00:46:10.640
He invites all of the Founding Fathers to
the altar to join, to -- as he puts it -- “purge

00:46:10.640 --> 00:46:14.539
as one”, but before President Warrens can
do the honors, they are attacked by the rebellion,

00:46:14.539 --> 00:46:18.180
and for the first time, the President of the
United States is legally purged.

00:46:18.180 --> 00:46:22.430
Chaos breaks loose and a huge firefight erupts,
where many secret service agents get purged,

00:46:22.430 --> 00:46:26.079
but through everything, both presidential
candidates manage to survive.

00:46:26.079 --> 00:46:29.420
Owens hides in a chamber below the church,
but he’s captured by Bishop’s troops.

00:46:29.420 --> 00:46:32.559
When Dante puts the gun to his head the minister
actually begs to be purged.

00:46:32.559 --> 00:46:36.589
I think this is less of a case of Owens actually
starting to believe in his own phony religion,

00:46:36.589 --> 00:46:40.809
and more of a case of Owens actually having
been so brainwashed by his political party,

00:46:40.809 --> 00:46:43.900
he genuinely starts to value their success
over his own life.

00:46:43.900 --> 00:46:47.479
If he’s taken out, he becomes a martyr,
and it’s likely that the NFFA rallies around

00:46:47.479 --> 00:46:50.089
his replacement and it benefits their success
overall.

00:46:50.089 --> 00:46:51.640
Or maybe that isn’t it all.

00:46:51.640 --> 00:46:55.459
Maybe Minister Owens knows he’s going to
lose the election after people discover what

00:46:55.459 --> 00:46:56.700
he has in the next room.

00:46:56.700 --> 00:47:00.301
More than 10 people are kidnapped, and it’s
likely that he planned on purging all of them

00:47:00.301 --> 00:47:02.220
as part of the religious ceremony.

00:47:02.220 --> 00:47:06.130
Seeing this outrages Senator Roan, and she
vows to destroy him on election day.

00:47:06.130 --> 00:47:10.039
After one last battle, Barnes and Bishop are
able to take down Danzinger and his men, as

00:47:10.039 --> 00:47:12.709
well as The NFFA priest, Harmon James.

00:47:12.709 --> 00:47:17.322
Much was sacrificed, but Roan and Owens both
survive the night in order to make it to election day.

00:47:17.322 --> 00:47:22.279
Two months later on May 26th 2040, the ballots
are cast, and Senator Roan keeps her promise

00:47:22.279 --> 00:47:25.250
by winning Florida, to push her over the top
and take the election.

00:47:25.250 --> 00:47:29.960
After more than 25 years the evil and corrupt
regime known as The New Founding Fathers of

00:47:29.960 --> 00:47:32.589
America would finally come to an end.

00:47:32.589 --> 00:47:35.930
With her first executive action, President
Roan would put a stop to The Purge.

00:47:35.930 --> 00:47:40.280
While the NFFA’s reign over the executive
office had come to a conclusion, their supporters

00:47:40.280 --> 00:47:42.199
weren’t about to go down without a fight.

00:47:42.199 --> 00:47:47.069
“We’re just now hearing reports about
a few scattered incidents around the country

00:47:47.069 --> 00:47:53.999
where NFFA supporters are reacting violently
to this defeat, they are burning cars, breaking

00:47:53.999 --> 00:47:56.369
windows, looting, attacking police officers…”

00:47:56.369 --> 00:48:00.630
But with the NFFA now out of office, I’m
going to go ahead and end this video.

00:48:00.630 --> 00:48:03.999
Hopefully this helped you better understand
how the NFFA operates and what their true

00:48:03.999 --> 00:48:05.420
goals and motivations were.

00:48:05.420 --> 00:48:07.910
If you love the Purge I’ve got more content
on the way.

00:48:07.910 --> 00:48:12.079
So go ahead and subscribe to CZsWorld for
new horrors every week, ring that deathbell

00:48:12.079 --> 00:48:15.229
for all notifications, and I’ll see you
in the next one.

00:48:15.229 --> 00:48:17.289
Assuming we both survive.

00:48:17.289 --> 00:48:21.279
And like the Purge, I recommend you stay home,
but if you do have to go out, wear a mask.

